## About

**RedaX** is an independent RPF9 exploration tool developed to make navigating and inspecting Grand Theft Auto VI game files easier.

Built with modern .NET technology, RedaX focuses on providing a dedicated desktop environment for working with GTA VI's RAGE engine archives.

The project aims to provide a clean, efficient, and accessible way to explore game archive structures and inspect their contents through a modern graphical interface.

## Features

- **RPF9 Exploration** — Open and explore GTA VI RPF9 archives.
- **Archive Inspection** — Inspect archive information and available file entries.
- **File Browsing** — Navigate discovered archive contents through a desktop interface.
- **Modern GUI** — A dedicated Windows application designed around a clean user experience.
- **Performance Focused** — Built using modern .NET technologies.
- **GTA VI Focused** — Developed specifically for exploring the next generation of RAGE engine game files.

## Supported Formats

| Format | Description |
|---|---|
| `.rpf` (RPF9) | GTA VI archive exploration and inspection |

*Additional format support will be documented as development progresses.*

## Technology

| Component | Technology |
|---|---|
| Framework | .NET 10 |
| Platform | Windows |
| Architecture | x64 |
| Target | GTA VI RAGE Engine |

